            "content": "<p>\"At this level, every detail is important - especially sleep 😴 7-9 hours is my sweet spot! I feel better in training both in the weight room & the pool.  Lagoon (the Otter pillow 🦦) has allowed me to get a better nights sleep for morning practice.  </p><p>Since using, I fall asleep pretty fast & if I'm up in the night because I have a snack or use the bathroom (bc I'm hydrated) I fall right back asleep. I'm really prioritizing my sleep routine to give me that extra edge in my training.\"    </p>",
